fcli is the official CLI for FreeSign (https://github.com/FreeSign-io/freesign),
a free, open-source eSignature platform.

FreeSign is a fork of Documenso (https://github.com/documenso/documenso),
released under the same AGPL-3.0 license. We are deeply grateful to the
Documenso team for their work, which made FreeSign and this CLI possible.

This CLI talks to the FreeSign HTTP API (and any compatible Documenso
deployment). It does not embed or redistribute any Documenso source code;
it is a separate clean-room client implementation in Go.
